<p>For these two games the process was pleasantly simple. Download the components once and play. If you prefer choosing a runner per game for your Epic library, <strong>Heroic</strong> is another option. My <a href="/blog/linux-gaming-steam-proton-lutris/">Linux gaming guide to Steam, Proton and Lutris</a> explains how launchers and compatibility layers fit together.</p>

